{"schema_version":1,"id":"y2_spring_roots_below_dialogue","title":"根系之下","start_node":"start","characters":["hero","mira"],"nodes":[{"id":"start","type":"line","speaker":"mira","text":"春之封印照亮了地圖，根系一直延伸到第二十層。那裡有一頭以舊鍛爐為巢的翼龍。","next":"answer"},{"id":"answer","type":"choice","options":[{"text":"第二枚封印也會回家。","next":"accept"},{"text":"我還需要更好的工具。","next":"later"}]},{"id":"accept","type":"action","actions":[{"type":"quest","quest_id":"y2_spring_roots_below_quest","state":"active"}],"next":"end"},{"id":"later","type":"line","speaker":"mira","text":"地圖會等你；危險也會。","next":"end"},{"id":"end","type":"end"}]}
